---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Terms & Conditions — Domaine d'Aubigny" description="Terms and conditions of sale." lang="en">
  <style>
    .legal { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 12vw, 96px) var(--pad-x); }
    .legal__title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .legal h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; margin: 32px 0 16px; }
    .legal p, .legal li { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--body); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .legal ul { margin-left: 24px; }
  </style>

  <section class="legal">
    <h1 class="legal__title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p>

    <h2>1. General</h2>
    <p>The sale of wines from Domaine d'Aubigny is subject to these terms and conditions. By placing an order, you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>2. Products & Pricing</h2>
    <p>Prices are in euros, including tax (TTC). Prices are subject to change without notice. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors.</p>

    <h2>3. Delivery</h2>
    <p>Delivery is subject to availability. Shipping costs are calculated at checkout. We ship to France and select EU countries only.</p>

    <h2>4. Payment</h2>
    <p>Payment is accepted via bank transfer and credit card. Payment must be received before shipment.</p>

    <h2>5. Age Verification</h2>
    <p>Alcohol sales are prohibited to minors under 18 years of age. By purchasing, you confirm you are of legal age.</p>

    <h2>6. Returns & Complaints</h2>
    <p>Damaged bottles must be reported within 48 hours of receipt. Refunds are issued for defective products.</p>

    <h2>7. Liability</h2>
    <p>Domaine d'Aubigny is not liable for losses arising from wine storage or handling after delivery.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions regarding these terms, contact: contact@aubigny.wine</p>
  </section>
</Base>
